;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"6\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.25em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.898); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 17px;\">2026 年 7 月 15 日下午，广东省项目管理协会顾问潘奇俊，数智监理委员会主任王倩倩，广东永贤工程管理有限公司董事长刘天宇及秘书处一行，赴理事单位广东省城规建设监理有限公司（简称 &ldquo;省城规监理&rdquo;）走访交流。省城规监理总经理吴祖强、副总工程师李汉坤及业务骨干出席座谈，本次交流由协会副秘书长戴晓伟主持。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"8\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; height: 0px; margin-bottom: unset; overflow: hidden;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"6\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"8\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"403\" data-backw=\"538\" data-imgfileid=\"100015714\" data-width=\"100%\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202607/%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%AE%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; vertical-align: bottom; border-radius: initial; background-color: transparent !important; background-size: 0px !important;\" type=\"block\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-nest-level=\"8\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"6\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><span data-nest-level=\"10\" leaf=\"\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">吴祖强总经理对协会一行到访表示热烈欢迎，并系统介绍企业发展沿革、经营概况与核心竞争优势。他指出，省城规监理对协会组织行业交流、开展专业服务、开展行业标准化建设等工作表示认可。同时，结合行业发展实际提出相关期许与建议：</span><span data-nest-level=\"10\" leaf=\"\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">一是希望协会持续畅通企协沟通渠道，丰富培训、调研、行业交流等活动；二是常态化收集企业发展难题，梳理行业共性痛点；三是完善会员反馈机制，兼顾会员差异化需求，优化资源对接、信息共享服务。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"6\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"8\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"717\" data-backw=\"538\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qlogo.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fB7rIgYqibXN5nnQPTUz7gicNiaLgr9NLiag5UWp4gKsoY8fxicZwTK9FwS3djfmQ4EAG0fHdQAHHONYRic72Ie8B69haYqfJYy5EwLXBGS1ibTC5c/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropx1=\"0\" data-cropx2=\"1280\" data-cropy1=\"352.1189591078067\" data-cropy2=\"1705.8736059479554\" data-imgfileid=\"100015715\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202607/%E5%90%B4%E7%A5%96%E5%BC%BA.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; vertical-align: bottom; border-radius: initial; background-color: transparent !important; background-size: 0px !important;\" type=\"block\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-nest-level=\"8\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"6\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><span data-nest-level=\"10\" leaf=\"\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">潘奇俊代表协会，对省城规监理多年来的大力支持表示感谢。并围绕行业痛点提出三点倡议：</span><span data-nest-level=\"10\" leaf=\"\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">第一，针对项目管理&ldquo;责任主体缺位&rdquo;困境，呼吁完善法律权责体系，消除制度障碍；第二，面对取费标准滞后现状，倡导建立适配全过程服务的一体化计价机制，杜绝低价竞争；第三，聚焦数字化赋能，分享AI识别、无人机巡检等技术的落地案例，推动智慧监管场景加速应用。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"6\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"8\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"718\" data-backw=\"538\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fB7rIgYqibXOw5AQpWZ6ta4OxGBY6eMSlGOcicJWrTXZ4zPYfoOcqwcbCfNF6tAcmvc8cCdSELdjoVwbWausVsoMFvsatZhkHYviaNoP2hfht4/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropx1=\"0\" data-cropx2=\"1279\" data-cropy1=\"358.9758364312267\" data-cropy2=\"1706.9182156133827\" data-imgfileid=\"100015716\" 