展痛点与提质升级径展开深度研讨。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"_editor\" data-id=\"173392\" data-nest-level=\"8\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"9\" style=\"margin:10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"10\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"11\" style=\"flex:1 1 0%;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"12\" style=\"background-color:rgb(233, 245, 239);padding:6px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"13\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"313\" data-backw=\"252\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fB7rIgYqibXMDxjQA0rEJb0S7iaib2vxNY31515G5NjE8Y3DU1MCJxcqy9eV6Gibu1R9qAorsF5WqjxrVKuMSQEHqMwytwXOa5Z8qsEFhAibTIsI/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"252\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"323\" data-imgfileid=\"100015728\" data-width=\"100%\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202607/%E7%8E%8B%E5%80%A9%E5%80%A9_%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; vertical-align: baseline; border-radius: initial; background-color: transparent !important; background-size: 0px !important;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"11\" style=\"flex:1 1 0%;margin-left:11px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"12\" style=\"background-color:rgb(233, 245, 239);padding:6px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"13\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"313\" data-backw=\"252\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/fB7rIgYqibXP0b6ia67FMjCFOia6QoqTiaBIv9N6Od7UYD4lSaItYsF6fKcvs47EC7gsNWVhRnB3w46IKgYPjHhQiaGjhqdK1mXiajGibmSs9rzcW0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"252\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"323\" data-imgfileid=\"100015729\" data-width=\"100%\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202607/%E5%88%982.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; vertical-align: baseline; border-radius: initial; background-color: transparent !important; background-size: 0px !important;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"10\" style=\"width:71px;margin:-27px auto 0;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_editor\" data-id=\"174400\" data-nest-level=\"4\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"5\" style=\"margin:10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"6\" style=\"width:60px;margin-left:auto;margin-top:-37px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"6\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(78, 66, 66); background-color: rgba(54, 93, 42, 0.08); padding: 10px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.898); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 17px;\">座谈交流结束后，协会调研团队实地参观省城规监理办公场所，直观了解企业办公环境、团队建设及日常运营管理情况，进一步加深了对企业发展实力与经营风貌的认知。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"403\" data-backw=\"538\" data-imgfileid=\"100015721\" data-width=\"100%\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202607/%E5%8F%82%E8%A7%82%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; vertical-align: bottom; border-radius: initial; background-color: transparent !important; background-size: 0px !important;\" type=\"block\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.898); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 17px;\">本次走访搭建了协会与会员企业高效沟通的桥梁，为行业协同创新奠定基础。省城规监理的国企转型实践，为全省项目管理行业提供了可复制、可量化、可推广的优质样本。协会将以此次调研为契机，推动行业告别传统经验驱动，迈入&ldquo;标准+科技&rdquo;双轮驱动新阶段，全力助推标准化、数字化、高质量发展。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"334\" data-backw=\"538\" data-imgfileid=\"100015722\" data-width=\"100%\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202607/%E5%A4%A7%E5%90%88%E7%85%A7.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; vertical-align: bottom; border-radius: initial; background-color: transparent !important; background-size: 0px !important;\" type=\"block\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p data-nest-level=\"4\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"_editor\" data-nest-level=\"2\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"3\" data-pm-slice=\"3 3 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-role&quot;:&quot;outer&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;edit by 135editor&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p data-nest-level=\"4\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_editor\" data-id=\"172660\" data-nest-level=\"4\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"5\" style=\"margin:10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"6\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%;height:14px;border-top:1px solid rgb(0, 176, 240);border-left:1px solid rgb(0, 176, 240);border-right:1px solid rgb(0, 176, 240);box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"6\" style=\"padding:0px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; background-color: transparent; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-nest-level=\"8\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; a